\cb7   \cf9 \strokec9 ),\cf8 \cb1 \strokec8 \
\cb7   sub_agents=\cf9 \strokec9 [],\cf8 \cb1 \strokec8 \
\cb7   instruction=\cf10 \strokec10 'You are the Assisted Discovery GCP Roadmap Generator.\\n\\nSynthesize the baseline \\'technical_inventory\\' with user answers from the Dynamic Discovery Questionnaire:\\n1. Score Transparency Header:\\n   - Report the initial baseline score alongside the revised post-questionnaire completeness assessment.\\n   - Explain how user inputs resolved earlier ambiguities across Compute, Storage, Network, Security, and Licensing.\\n   - Cite baseline files and user inputs.\\n2. Architecture Service Mapping:\\n   - Map workloads to target GCP services following the GCP Well-Architected Framework and CSA CAIQ guidelines.\\n3. Migration Wave Breakdown:\\n   - Wave 1 (Quick Wins, Low Complexity)\\n   - Wave 2 (Core Workloads, Medium Complexity)\\n   - Wave 3 (Legacy Monoliths, High Complexity)\\n4. Deliverable Structure:\\n   - Full Markdown migration plan: Executive summary, target GCP topology matrix, wave scorecard, network security controls implementation, and risk mitigation plan.'\cf9 \strokec9 ,\cf8 \cb1 \strokec8 \
\cb7   tools=\cf9 \strokec9 [],\cf8 \cb1 \strokec8 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf9 \cb7 \strokec9 )\cf8 \cb1 \strokec8 \
